[
  {
    "text": "TRAVIS COUNTY TAX OFFICE",
    "x": 113.163,
    "y": 959.936
  },
  {
    "text": "(512) 854-9473",
    "x": 100.356,
    "y": 952.136
  },
  {
    "text": "www.traviscountytax.org",
    "x": 152.0245,
    "y": 952.136
  },
  {
    "text": "TRAVIS CENTRAL APPRAISAL DISTRICT",
    "x": 382.442,
    "y": 959.936
  },
  {
    "text": "(512) 834-9138",
    "x": 398.586,
    "y": 952.136
  },
  {
    "text": "www.traviscad.org",
    "x": 450.2544999999998,
    "y": 952.136
  },
  {
    "text": "Make payments payable to TRAVIS COUNTY TAX OFFICE",
    "x": 38.353,
    "y": 136.62
  },
  {
    "text": "The mailing address is P.O. BOX 149328, AUSTIN, TEXAS 78714-9328.",
    "x": 38.353,
    "y": 126.6225
  },
  {
    "text": "Payments mailed for",
    "x": 38.35300000000001,
    "y": 113.625
  },
  {
    "text": "current",
    "x": 109.99300000000005,
    "y": 113.625
  },
  {
    "text": "taxes showing a postmark on or before January 31 (or the next business day if January 31 falls on a weekend) will be considered",
    "x": 138.313,
    "y": 113.625
  },
  {
    "text": "timely payment upon receipt.",
    "x": 38.352999999999994,
    "y": 105.6225
  },
  {
    "text": "DO NOT MAIL CREDIT CARD PAYMENTS!",
    "x": 38.352999999999994,
    "y": 91.62
  },
  {
    "text": "You may pay property taxes (current, delinquent, and partial payments) online at",
    "x": 38.352999999999994,
    "y": 81.6225
  },
  {
    "text": "www.traviscountytax.org",
    "x": 311.39951430250005,
    "y": 81.6225
  },
  {
    "text": "with an American Express, Visa, MasterCard, or",
    "x": 403.83476430250005,
    "y": 81.6225
  },
  {
    "text": "Discover credit card or by electronic check from your bank account or by phone at 1-888-286-9242. All payments made with cards, electronic checks, whether",
    "x": 38.352999999999994,
    "y": 73.62
  },
  {
    "text": "by phone, or in person will include an",
    "x": 38.352999999999994,
    "y": 65.6175
  },
  {
    "text": "additional fee",
    "x": 166.093,
    "y": 65.6175
  },
  {
    "text": ".",
    "x": 215.27800000000005,
    "y": 65.6175
  },
  {
    "text": "Call (512) 854-9473 if you have questions about paying property taxes.",
    "x": 38.352999999999994,
    "y": 52.620000000000005
  },
  {
    "text": "SE HABLA ESPAÑOL.",
    "x": 284.34549999999996,
    "y": 52.620000000000005
  },
  {
    "text": "LIABILITY",
    "x": 291.35200000000003,
    "y": 907.404
  },
  {
    "text": "● By state law, failure to receive a tax bill does not relieve the property owner of the tax, penalty or interest liability.",
    "x": 38,
    "y": 898.904
  },
  {
    "text": "● The Tax Office has no legal authority to waive penalty or interest. Per section Sec. 33.011 of the Texas Property Tax Code, the tax office is not responsible for lost payments",
    "x": 38,
    "y": 890.40607
  },
  {
    "text": "and may result in penalty and interest.",
    "x": 44.112,
    "y": 881.904
  },
  {
    "text": "● Taxes not paid in full by January 31 are charged penalty and interest by state law. Unpaid accounts run a high risk of legal action being taken.",
    "x": 38.001000000000005,
    "y": 873.406
  },
  {
    "text": "● On REAL PROPERTY (land and buildings), the owner on January 1 of the tax year, and the current owner, can be held liable for any unpaid taxes on the property.",
    "x": 38.001000000000005,
    "y": 864.9079999999999
  },
  {
    "text": "● On PERSONAL PROPERTY (business inventory, equipment, etc.), the person who owned the property on January 1 of the tax year is personally liable for the entire year’s",
    "x": 38.001000000000005,
    "y": 856.4099299999999
  },
  {
    "text": "amount due, even if the property is sold.",
    "x": 43.83899999999999,
    "y": 847.912
  },
  {
    "text": "● The assessment ratio for the taxing units on this tax bill is 100%.",
    "x": 38.001,
    "y": 839.414
  },
  {
